PROVED construction and full proof. Write u=q^(1/3), H=4u², ℓ=ceil(u), and C=q u(u−2). We construct a nonnegative even h and then set z=h−u. Impose h(0)=u−1, h(±1)=H, and require

    sum h=q(u−1),     sum h²=q²+q u(u−2).

